type: dataset
title: "State-Owned ASes: ASes of State-Owned Internet Operators"
abstract: >-
  Archival dataset of Autonomous Systems operated by majority state-owned Internet
  operators (and a partial list of minority state-owned ones), with the evidence that
  confirmed state ownership. Ownership reflects June 2019 to November 2020.
